                            text: "Line length decides how far the eye travels before it returns to the left edge. Most readers are comfortable somewhere around 60 to 75 characters per line, which is why this column is capped near 760 pixels. The full specification lives in the <a href=\"#spec\">type guidelines</a>, and the earlier draft is <a href=\"https://example.com/draft\">archived here</a>."
