                            text: "Vertical rhythm follows from the baseline. With a line height of 1.6, each line sits far enough from its neighbour to breathe, and a paragraph gap of one line keeps sections distinct without turning the page into a list of islands.\nA forced line break, like this one, is useful for addresses and poems but should be rare in running text."
